# --- Secrets -----------------------------------------------------------------
# `.env` alone was not enough: README.md tells you to put GEMINI_API_KEY in
# `.env.local`, which the old pattern did not match. One `git add -A` after a
# `npm run dev` and the key was in the history.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

